The Burgle Cats' gacha is accessible in the '''Cat Hunter''' (ネコハンタ) with a [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]] wearing a orange cap with the label "HUNTER", this option allows the player to obtain new Cats for Burgle Battles.
* Using 3 Silver Tickets will unlock a Normal, Rare or Super Rare Burgle Cat.
* Using either 1 Rare Ticket or 150 [[Cat Food]] will unlock a Rare, Super Rare or Uber Rare Burgle Cat.
* Using a Platinum Ticket will guarantee an Uber Rare Burgle Cat. This Ticket's pool is not affected by current banners, thus making it not possible to pull limited Cats using this item.

Uber Rare Cats drop rate increases by 1.5 times during Huntfest banners.

