==Gala Banners==
During those galas, Uber Rare drop rate will be increased by 1.5 times (from 9% to 14%), they consist of 2 types:
*Uber Huntfest, which occurs at the start of every month and lasts 1 week. This banner offers limited Cats with exclusive abilities.
*Mega Huntfest, which occurs in the middle of every month and lasts 1 week. This banner offers a second Uber Rare Cat for every regular ability in the game.
All the limited Cats have innate stats (Willpower, Horizontal and Vertical speed).

